- `/home/daniel/sandbox/src/main/java/org/springframework/samples/petclinic/rest/function/owner/EnsureDailyLimit.java` — consumes the rolled date; its Javadoc explicitly references `RollRegistrationDateToBusinessDay` and notes the count is "per business day."

