Supporting test infrastructure (helpers `createOwnerOk`, `fetchOwner`, `structuredOwner` used above) lives in `/home/daniel/sandbox/src/test/java/org/springframework/samples/petclinic/acceptance/AcceptanceBase.java`, with `/home/daniel/sandbox/src/test/java/org/springframework/samples/petclinic/acceptance/AuditLogCapture.java`. These do not themselves test business-day logic.

